---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const devices = await getCollection('devices');
const viaDevices = devices.filter(d => d.data.firmwareUrl);
---

<Layout title="Centro de Software y Calibración - Antares Tech" description="Descargá y configurá el software para tus periféricos Antares Tech: QMK & VIA (AntaKnob, Macropad), DXTweak2 (Freno de Mano y Pedalera Logitech 12-Bit) y SimHub (iFlag LED Simracing).">
    <div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none bg-[#d5d0c8] dark:bg-[#030014] transition-colors duration-700">
        <div 
            class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.25] dark:opacity-[0.7] transition-opacity duration-700" 
            style="background: 
                linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pcb-line) 2px, transparent 2px),
                linear-gradient(225deg, var(--pcb-line) 2px, transparent 2px),
                radial-gradient(var(--pcb-pad) 4px, transparent 4px);
                background-size: 60px 60px, 60px 60px, 60px 60px;
                background-position: 0 0, 30px 0, 30px 30px;
                background-color: var(--pcb-bg);"
        ></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#d5d0c8]/40 via-[#d5d0c8]/80 to-[#d5d0c8] dark:from-transparent dark:via-[#030014]/80 dark:to-[#030014] transition-colors duration-700"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-40 -mt-20 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 dark:bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-40 -mb-20 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 dark:bg-cyan-600/10 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>

    <main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen relative z-10">
        
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 mb-12 group/back">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mr-2 group-hover/back:-translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></svg>
            Volver al inicio
        </a>
        <div class="scroll-reveal mb-12">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 via-cyan-500 to-fuchsia-500 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 text-white">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/>
                        <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Ecosistema de Software & Firmware</span>
            </div>

            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6">
                Centro de Software<br/>
                <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-cyan-500 to-fuchsia-500 dark:from-indigo-400 dark:via-cyan-400 dark:to-fuchsia-400">& Calibración Hardware</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mb-8">
                Configurá, calibrá y personalizá todos tus dispositivos Antares Tech. Desde remapeo de teclas en tiempo real con <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-bold">QMK & VIA</strong>, hasta calibración fina de zonas muertas con <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-bold">DXTweak2</strong> para freno de mano y pedalera, y telemetría en pista con <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-bold">SimHub</strong>.
            </p>

            <!-- Pestañas de Filtrado Rápido -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/10" id="software-tabs">
                <button 
                    type="button" 
                    data-tab="all" 
                    class="sw-tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-gray-900 text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-gray-900 shadow-md cursor-pointer"
                >
                    ✨ Todos
                </button>
                <button 
                    type="button" 
                    data-tab="qmk" 
                    class="sw-tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-white/70 dark:bg-white/[0.04] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] cursor-pointer"
                >
                    ⌨️ QMK & VIA (Productividad)
                </button>
                <button 
                    type="button" 
                    data-tab="dxtweak" 
                    class="sw-tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-white/70 dark:bg-white/[0.04] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] cursor-pointer"
                >
                    🕹️ DXTweak2 (Freno & Pedales)
                </button>
                <button 
                    type="button" 
                    data-tab="simhub" 
                    class="sw-tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 bg-white/70 dark:bg-white/[0.04] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-900 dark:hover:text-white border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] cursor-pointer"
                >
                    🏎️ SimHub (iFlag Telemetría)
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- SECCIÓN 1: QMK FIRMWARE & VIA CONFIGURATOR -->
        <section id="via-qmk" class="sw-section mb-16 scroll-reveal" data-category="qmk">
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c0a1a] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/5 dark:shadow-indigo-950/30 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] ring-1 ring-white/20 dark:ring-white/[0.05] relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
                                <path d="M6 8h.01M10 8h.01M14 8h.01M18 8h.01M6 12h.01M10 12h.01M14 12h.01M18 12h.01M8 16h8"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-200/50 dark:border-indigo-500/20">100% Web · Sin Instalación</span>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight mt-1">QMK Firmware & VIA Configurator</h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="https://usevia.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-cyan-500 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-cyan-400 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                        Abrir usevia.app
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 font-light">
                    <p>
                        Nuestros controladores como el <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">AntaKnob</strong> y <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">Macropads</strong> incorporan de fábrica el firmware open-source <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">QMK</strong>. Esto garantiza una tasa de sondeo ultra-rápida de 1000 Hz (1 ms), memoria interna EEPROM (tus configuraciones quedan guardadas en el dispositivo sin depender de una PC) y compatibilidad total con <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">VIA</strong> directamente desde Google Chrome, Edge u Opera vía WebHID.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Archivos JSON para descargar -->
                <h3 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
                    Archivos de Definición (.JSON) para VIA
                </h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-10">
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 dark:border-white/10 shrink-0">
                                <img src="/images/antaknob.jpg" alt="AntaKnob" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white">AntaKnob</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">knob_via.json</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <a href="/downloads/knob_via.json" download class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors shadow-sm">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
                            Descargar
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-between gap-4 opacity-75">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-300 dark:border-white/10 shrink-0 grayscale">
                                <img src="/images/macropad.jpg" alt="Macropad 12+1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Macropad 12+1</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">macropad-12-1.json</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 bg-gray-200/50 dark:bg-white/[0.05] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg">Próximamente</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pasos de configuración VIA -->
                <h3 class="text-sm font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">¿Cómo configurar en 3 pasos?</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08]">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center mb-3">1</div>
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Entrá a usevia.app</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light">Abrí el navegador e ingresá en <a href="https://usevia.app" target="_blank" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-semibold underline">usevia.app</a> con tu periférico conectado por USB.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08]">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center mb-3">2</div>
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Cargá el archivo JSON</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light">En VIA andá a <em>Settings</em> y activá "Show Design tab". Luego en la pestaña <em>Design</em> cargá el archivo JSON de tu producto.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08]">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center mb-3">3</div>
                        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Personalizá en tiempo real</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-light">En la pestaña <em>Configure</em> cambiá teclas, volumen, encoders o macros. Los cambios se guardan al instante en la memoria del hardware.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN 2: DXTWEAK2 (CALIBRACIÓN SIMRACING PARA FRENO Y PEDALERA) -->
        <section id="dxtweak" class="sw-section mb-16 scroll-reveal" data-category="dxtweak">
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c0a1a] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/5 dark:shadow-indigo-950/30 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] ring-1 ring-white/20 dark:ring-white/[0.05] relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-fuchsia-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-fuchsia-500/20">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <line x1="4" y1="21" x2="4" y2="14"/>
                                <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="4" y2="3"/>
                                <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="12"/>
                                <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="3"/>
                                <line x1="20" y1="21" x2="20" y2="16"/>
                                <line x1="20" y1="12" x2="20" y2="3"/>
                                <line x1="1" y1="14" x2="7" y2="14"/>
                                <line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/>
                                <line x1="17" y1="16" x2="23" y2="16"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-fuchsia-50 dark:bg-fuchsia-500/10 text-fuchsia-600 dark:text-fuchsia-400 border border-fuchsia-200/50 dark:border-fuchsia-500/20">SimRacing DirectInput · Portable (.zip)</span>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight mt-1">DXTweak2 - Herramienta de Calibración</h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                        <a href="/downloads/DXTweak2.zip" download class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-fuchsia-600 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-fuchsia-500 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
                            Descargar DXTweak2 (.zip)
                        </a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qVXqMrxvKwE&t=207s" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-red-500/10 hover:bg-red-500/20 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 border border-red-500/30 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold uppercase text-xs tracking-wider transition-colors">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19.615 3.184c-3.604-.246-11.631-.245-15.23 0-3.897.266-4.356 2.62-4.385 8.816.029 6.185.484 8.549 4.385 8.816 3.6.245 11.626.246 15.23 0 3.897-.266 4.356-2.62 4.385-8.816-.029-6.185-.484-8.549-4.385-8.816zm-10.615 12.816v-8l8 3.993-8 4.007z"/></svg>
                            Video Guía (Minuto 3:27)
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-light">
                    <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium">DXTweak2</strong> es una utilidad portable gratuita para Windows que interactúa directamente a nivel DirectInput. No requiere instalación ni consume recursos en segundo plano. Es la solución recomendada por la comunidad simracing para calibrar con precisión milimétrica zonas muertas y curvas de respuesta en tus periféricos Antares Tech:
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
                    <!-- Tarjeta Handbrake -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08]">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                                🕹️ Freno de Mano (Handbrake)
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">USB Plug & Play</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-2 font-light">
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Zona Muerta Inicial</strong>: Permite dejar un margen de reposo para que las vibraciones del cockpit o apoyar la mano no activen el freno accidentalmente.</li>
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Tope al 100% Personalizado</strong>: Asegurá el bloqueo completo de las ruedas con el tirón que a vos te resulte cómodo y natural.</li>
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Respuesta Inmediata</strong>: Cero delay para rally y drift en Assetto Corsa, DiRT Rally 2.0 y EA WRC.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tarjeta Pedalera Logitech -->
                    <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08]">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
                                🏎️ Adaptador Pedalera Logitech
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-fuchsia-500/10 text-fuchsia-600 dark:text-fuchsia-400">12-Bit · 4096 Pasos</span>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-2 font-light">
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Calibración de Acelerador, Freno y Embrague</strong>: Ajustá cada pedal de forma individual aprovechando los 4096 niveles reales del microcontrolador RP2040.</li>
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Curvas de Frenada Progresiva</strong>: Configurá la curva no lineal para modular el freno al límite del bloqueo sin necesidad de Logitech G-HUB.</li>
                            <li>• <strong class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">Zona Muerta Final</strong>: Alcanzá el 100% de potencia de frenado sin tener que pararte sobre el pedal.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pasos de uso DXTweak2 -->
                <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-50/50 dark:bg-white/[0.02] border border-indigo-200/50 dark:border-white/[0.06]">
                    <h4 class="text-xs font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Instrucciones de uso rápido:</h4>
                    <ol class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-1.5 list-decimal list-inside font-light">
                        <li>Descomprimí el archivo <code class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-mono">DXTweak2.zip</code> y ejecutá <code class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-mono">DXTweak2.exe</code> (no requiere instalación).</li>
                        <li>En la lista desplegable superior seleccioná tu dispositivo: <em>"Antartech Adapter 12-Bit"</em> o <em>"PICO / ANTABRAKE"</em>.</li>
                        <li>Pisá el pedal o tirá de la palanca para ver el eje activo en pantalla. Ajustá los valores de <strong>Min</strong>, <strong>Max</strong> y <strong>Deadzone</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Hacé clic en <strong>Apply</strong> / <strong>Save</strong> para guardar la calibración en Windows. ¡Listo para correr!</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECCIÓN 3: SIMHUB (TELEMETRÍA & IFLAG LED) -->
        <section id="simhub" class="sw-section mb-16 scroll-reveal" data-category="simhub">
            <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c0a1a] p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/5 dark:shadow-indigo-950/30 border border-gray-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.08] ring-1 ring-white/20 dark:ring-white/[0.05] relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
